A63. Mom's ambition for Jr. (abbr.). ~ PRES
A64. The price of defeat. ~ REPARATION

D1. End of all good men who come to the aid of their party. ~ WASHINGTON
D2. The worry conjunction. ~ IF
D3. This red causes a lot of political tie-ups. ~ TAPE
D4. Before. ~ ERE
D5. Old female political roosters. ~ HENS
D6. What convention drinks will do. ~ OSSIFY
D7. The kind of property a fence takes in. ~ STOLEN
D8. Seagoing eagles. ~ ERNES
D9. What the Pres. and Congress really should sing. ~ DUO
D10. A politician's answer to a political question. ~ UM
D11. Soporific spellbinder. ~ SPIELER
D12. What a few drinks cause between political opponents. ~ THAW
D15. Possessive pronoun. ~ ITS
