D30. Supporters of piggish parties. ~ HAMS
D31. A vote getter. ~ BUCK
D32. He'd like to Landon Roosevelt or Borah him to death. ~ REPUBLICAN
D34. This helps a far-sighted President see things closer at hand. ~ LENS
D35. A tie-up in the shoe business. ~ LACE
D36. What loyal sons usually become (pl.). ~ DADS
D38. Kind of fellow we like in the White House. ~ REGULAR
D39. A shifty proposition. ~ GEAR
